vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布支持特朗普AI行政令，将配合模型发布前政府安全评估</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cloudflare监测显示机器人流量占比超57%，互联网或全面转向付费抓取模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云发布音视频AI品牌WAND，内置六大自研模型与60+项AI能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dd79068710eb030bec9c04638f92175.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云音视频正式发布AI原生能力底座WAND，标志着其从单点媒体处理向Agent-Native模式的战略升级。WAND架构由模型引擎、能力层和场景方案三层构成，内置编解码、增强、擦除、生成、理解及音频六大自研媒体专用模型，并整合了60+项媒体AI能力。该底座支持API、Agent预编排工作流（Agentic Workflow）和Skills三种接入模式，可实现Agent端到端自动跑通生产链路。在应用层面，WAND在电商、短漫剧及赛事直播等场景表现突出，其中短漫剧生产效率提升90%，赛事直播场景较传统方案节省超50%码率。目前，WAND已服务国内80%以上的头部漫剧平台，并支撑了数千场全球顶级赛事。通过将音视频能力转化为可被Agent统一调度的生产级工具，腾讯云旨在全面赋能AI Agent时代的视听应用创新。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国众议院发布269页AI立法草案：巨头面临半年一审，州级监管权冻结三年</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97cf32890bed12ea8b3a96c0d7d593b6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国众议院两党议员近日公布《伟大美国人工智能法案（Great American Artificial Intelligence Act of 2026）》讨论稿，旨在通过联邦框架强化前沿AI模型监管。法案规定，上一年收入超5亿美元且训练过大型前沿模型的企业（如OpenAI、谷歌DeepMind、Anthropic），必须每半年聘请独立机构核查安全计划，防范网络攻击及灾难性风险，违规者面临每日最高100万美元罚款。草案核心争议点在于“州法优先权”，即未来三年内禁止州及地方政府制定专门监管AI模型开发的法律，旨在统一联邦标准。此外，法案还涵盖了员工举报保护、AI金融诈骗量刑加重、AI就业影响研究及K-12 AI素养教育等内容。目前该草案处于征求反馈阶段，行业组织NetChoice对强制审计及商业秘密泄露风险表示担忧</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布支持特朗普AI行政令，将配合模型发布前政府安全评估</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式表态支持美国总统特朗普签署的人工智能模型发布前审查行政命令，并确认将参与相关评估流程。OpenAI负责各国事务的负责人乔治·奥斯本表示，公司将签署该自愿性质的行政命令，不会被动等待监管要求。根据该行政命令，联邦政府可在模型正式发布前30天获取访问权限，并要求企业参与基准测试，以评估模型在网络能力等方面的先进程度，从而界定“受监管的前沿模型”。奥斯本强调，OpenAI正主动向各国政府建议建立强有力且具备灵活性的监管机构，以适应技术快速演进。此举标志着OpenAI在面对联邦政府强化审查压力时，采取了主动合作的姿态，旨在平衡前沿AI创新与国家安全监管要求，为行业设定模型发布前的合规基准。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cloudflare监测显示机器人流量占比超57%，互联网或全面转向付费抓取模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e36765e1131c7c20912db2cc8090cc2a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cloudflare监测数据显示，互联网机器人流量已正式超越人类流量，占比达到57.4%，这一趋势较预期提前爆发。受AI智能体与爬虫访问激增驱动，Cloudflare CEO马修·普林斯认为互联网生态将发生颠覆性变革，全面走向“付费抓取”时代。为应对流量格局剧变，Cloudflare正开发全新的底层基础设施与协议，旨在支持未来高频结算与流量控制需求，帮助网站所有者将自动化访问转化为商业变现机遇。此前Cloudflare曾推出允许网站拦截AI爬虫并对数据抓取收费的服务，但受限于配套生态未获广泛应用。随着谷歌AI概述等功能普及，用户获取信息方式正从传统网页浏览向AI总结转变，行业需从对抗思维转向构建全新的数据价值交换体系。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于6月4日发布文章《当AI构建自身》，披露AI在代码编写与系统优化方面的惊人进展，并呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发以防范失控风险。数据显示，截至2026年5月，Anthropic代码库中超80%代码由Claude自主编写，工程师代码交付量较2024年同期增长8倍。在模型训练优化测试中，Claude加速能力已达52倍，且AI独立完成任务的时长缩短至每4个月翻倍。Anthropic警告，AI正逼近“递归自我改进”阶段，即在无人类介入下自主升级，若当前模型存在微小“不对齐”，该风险将随迭代呈复利放大。公司建议建立全球协调机制，在必要时主动放慢研发节奏，为AI对齐研究留出调适时间。尽管Anthropic已启动IPO筹备，年化收入突破470亿美元，但其此次公开呼吁反映了前沿科技在商业扩张与技术安全之间的深刻悖</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
